0">You're </span><span begin="01:08.910" end="01:10.050">intertwining </span><span begin="01:10.050" end="01:10.200">your </span><span begin="01:10.200" end="01:10.980">soul </span><span begin="01:10.980" end="01:11.070">with </span><span begin="01:11.070" end="01:12.150">somebody </span><span begin="01:12.150" end="01:13.710">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.390" end="01:16.890"><span begin="01:15.390" end="01:15.750">I'm </span><span begin="01:15.750" end="01:16.200">looking </span><span begin="01:16.200" end="01:16.590">through </span><span begin="01:16.590" end="01:16.890">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.890" end="01:19.260"><span begin="01:16.890" end="01:17.220">While </span><span begin="01:17.220" end="01:17.400">you're </span><span begin="01:17.400" end="01:18.000">looking </span><span begin="01:18.000" end="01:18.360">through </span><span begin="01:18.360" end="01:18.510">your </span><span begin="01:18.510" end="01:19.260">phone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.260" end="01:22.590"><span begin="01:19.260" end="01:19.560">And </span><span begin="01:19.560" end="01:19.800">then </span><span begin="01:19.800" end="01:20.520">leaving </span><span begin="01:20.520" end="01:20.640">with </span><span begin="01:20.640" end="01:21.690">somebody </span><span begin="01:21.690" end="01:22.590">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.960" end="01:27.540"><span begin="01:24.960" end="01:25.440">Oh </span><span begin="01:25.440" end="01:26.010">I </span><span begin="01:26.010" end="01:26.400">don't </span><span begin="01:26.400" end="01:26.730">want </span><span begin="01:26.730" end="01:26.880">your </span><span begin="01:26.880" end="01:27.540">body</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.540" end="01:31.980"><span begin="01:27.540" end="01:27.930">But </span><span begin="01:27.930" end="01:28.110">I'm </span><span begin="01:28.110" end="01:29.070">picturing </span><span begin="01:29.070" end="01:29.250">your </span><span begin="